# v3.2.1: pin line endings — the strict encoding tests (test_b1_fixes) and
# the shipped archives must be LF on every platform. git archive applies
# autocrlf smudge on the packing machine; this attribute removes that
# platform dependence for the repository itself.
* text=auto eol=lf
# binary assets (never touch)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.exe binary
*.whl binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
